":func:`marquetry.model_archive.save_archive` / "
":func:`marquetry.model_archive.load_archive`)"

#: ../../release_note.rst:16
msgid ""
"Stores the computation graph and the weights in one file (zip of JSON + npz,"
" no pickle)"
msgstr "計算グラフと重みを1つのファイルに保存します(JSON + npz の zip、pickle 不使用)"

