":mod:`marquetry.preprocess` was renamed to :mod:`marquetry.preprocesses`"
msgstr ":mod:`marquetry.preprocess` は :mod:`marquetry.preprocesses` に変更"

#: ../../release_note.rst:171
msgid ""
"Preprocess functions improve user experience (auto detect the changing "
"prerequisite in the same dataset and so)"
msgstr "前処理の面倒な処理をフレームワーク側で吸収"

