msgid "Rename :meth:`logsumexp` to :meth:`log_sum_exp`"
msgstr ":meth:`logsumexp` は :meth:`log_sum_exp` に変更"

#: ../../release_note.rst:173
msgid ""
":meth:`repeat` support multi axis and ``repeat_num`` was renamed to "
"``repeats``"
msgstr ":meth:`repeat` は多軸をサポートし、 ``repeat_num`` は ``repeats`` に変更"

#: ../../release_note.rst:174
msgid ""
":class:`MatMul` and :meth:`matmul`'s arguments was renamed to `x0` and `x1` "
"from `x1` and `x2`"
msgstr ":class:`MatMul` と :meth:`matmul` の引数は `x1` と `x2` から `x0` と `x1` に変更"

#: ../../release_note.rst:175
msgid ""
":class:`Layer`'s save/load params method was renamed to :meth:`save_params` "
